  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "There should be a way to get the button / axis state (https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/input-events) only on demand. \nAdding an event that is always executed when a button / axis state changes is often a waste of ressources (especially given how slow Udon is) if I only need to know the state in some rare cases. \nSo we should be able to ask an API for the current state, e.g. bool GetInputUse(HandType), float GetInputMoveHorizontal()",
